{"slug":"580312-phaarookajjana-tota","title":"ಫಾರೂಕಜ್ಜನ ತೋಟ","titleEn":"Phaarookajjana Tota","level":"2","description":"","orientation":"landscape","cover":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/580312-phaarookajjana-tota/cover.jpg","width":548,"height":548},"audio":null,"provenance":{"source":"https://storyweaver.org.in/en/stories/580312-phaarookajjana-tota","license":"CC-BY-4.0","licenseNote":"Fetched from StoryWeaver's public API; the book's own attribution page states 'Released under CC BY 4.0 license' for the story and each illustration. Text is the page HTML with markup removed; illustrations are StoryWeaver's 700–960 px crops, unmodified apart from JPEG re-encoding; audio re-encoded to mono MP3.","storyweaverId":580312,"authors":["Matthew  Kalil "],"illustrators":["Sam  van Riet "],"translators":["Dr Akshata Shanbhag"],"publisher":"Pratham Books","publishedYear":"2023","originalStory":{"title":"Grandpa Farouk's Garden"},"copyrightNotice":"‘Phaarookajjana Tota’ has been published on StoryWeaver by Pratham Books. www.prathambooks.org.","attributionLine":"ಫಾರೂಕಜ್ಜನ ತೋಟ (Kannada), translated by Dr Akshata Shanbhag, based on original story Grandpa Farouk's Garden, written by Matthew  Kalil , illustrated by Sam  van Riet , published by Pratham Books (© Pratham Books, 2023) under a CC BY 4.0 license on StoryWeaver. Read, create and translate stories for free on www.storyweaver.org.in","imageCredits":[{"page":2,"title":"Man Walking through his garden","illustrator":"Sam van Riet","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2018"},{"page":3,"title":"Grandfather Talking to grandson","illustrator":"Sam van Riet","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2018"},{"page":4,"title":"Watering can","illustrator":"Sam van Riet","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2018"},{"page":5,"title":"Boy With his worm farm","illustrator":"Sam van Riet","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2018"},{"page":6,"title":"Green Pear","illustrator":"Sam van Riet","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2018"},{"page":7,"title":"Grandpa And grandson enjoying fruits","illustrator":"Sam van Riet","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2018"},{"page":8,"title":"Branches with leaf","illustrator":"Sam van Riet","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2018"},{"page":9,"title":"Garden In the Fall","illustrator":"Sam van Riet","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2018"},{"page":10,"title":"Grandfather Talking to grandson about beetles","illustrator":"Sam van Riet","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2018"},{"page":11,"title":"Happy Boy","illustrator":"Sam van Riet","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2018"},{"page":12,"title":"Curious Boy in garden","illustrator":"Sam van Riet","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2018"},{"page":13,"title":"Boy With beetle","illustrator":"Sam van Riet","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2018"},{"page":14,"title":"Boy Catching beetles","illustrator":"Sam van Riet","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2018"},{"page":15,"title":"Boy Releasing beetles","illustrator":"Sam van Riet","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2018"},{"page":16,"title":"Beetles Crawling in the house","illustrator":"Sam van Riet","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2018"},{"page":17,"title":"Grandson Giving beetles","illustrator":"Sam van Riet","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2018"},{"page":18,"title":"Man Releasing ladybugs into the garden","illustrator":"Sam van Riet","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2018"},{"page":19,"title":"Lively Garden","illustrator":"Sam van Riet","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2018"},{"page":20,"title":"Happy Grandfather and grandson in the garden","illustrator":"Sam van Riet","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2018"},{"page":21,"title":"Beetles On a leaf","illustrator":"Sam van Riet","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2018"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/580312-phaarookajjana-tota/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಊರ ನಡುವೆ, ಅನೇಕ ಮನೆ, ರಸ್ತೆಗಳ ನಡುವೆ ಫಾರೂಕಜ್ಜನ ತೋಟವಿದೆ."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/580312-phaarookajjana-tota/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಅಮೀರ್‌ನಿಗೆ ಎಲೆ, ಹೂವು, ಮರಗಳು ಎಂದರೆ ತುಂಬಾ ಇಷ್ಟ.","ವಾರಕ್ಕೊಮ್ಮೆ ಅವನು ಫಾರೂಕಜ್ಜನನ್ನು ಭೇಟಿಯಾಗಲು ಹೋಗುತ್ತಾನೆ."]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/580312-phaarookajjana-tota/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಹಾಗೆ ಹೋದಾಗಲೆಲ್ಲ ಗಿಡಗಳಿಗೆ ನೀರು ಹಾಕಲು ಸಹಾಯ ಮಾಡುತ್ತಾನೆ."]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/580312-phaarookajjana-tota/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಅವನು ಕಾಂಪೋಸ್ಟ್‌ ಗೊಬ್ಬರ ಮಾಡಲು ಸಹಾಯ ಮಾಡುತ್ತಾನೆ.","ಇಡೀ ದಿನ ಅಜ್ಜನ ಜೊತೆ ಕೆಲಸ ಮಾಡುತ್ತಿರುತ್ತಾನೆ."]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/580312-phaarookajjana-tota/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಕೆಲಸ ಎಲ್ಲ ಮುಗಿದ ಮೇಲೆ, ಅಜ್ಜ-ಮೊಮ್ಮಗ","ತೋಟದಲ್ಲಿ ಬೆಳೆದ ಹಣ್ಣಗಳನ್ನು ತಿನ್ನುತ್ತಾರೆ."]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/580312-phaarookajjana-tota/p06.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಒಂದು ದಿನ, ಅಜ್ಜ ತನ್ನ ಮರಸೇಬು ಹಣ್ಣನ್ನು ತಿನ್ನಲಿಲ್ಲ.","“ಯಾಕಜ್ಜ, ಏನಾಯಿತು?”","ಕೇಳಿದ ಅಮೀರ್."]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/580312-phaarookajjana-tota/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ನನ್ನ ತೋಟ ಇರಲ್ಲ ಇನ್ನು,” ಎಂದರು ಅಜ್ಜ.","“ಯಾಕೆ?” ಎಂದು ಕೇಳಿದ ಅಮೀರ್."]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/580312-phaarookajjana-tota/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["“ಹತ್ತಿರ ಹೋಗಿ ನೋಡು,” ಎಂದರು ಅಜ್ಜ.","“ಯಾವುದೋ ಕೀಟಗಳು ಗಿಡಗಳನ್ನೆಲ್ಲ ತಿನ್ನುತ್ತಿವೆ.”"]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/580312-phaarookajjana-tota/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["“ಈಗ ಇಲ್ಲಿ ಜೀರುಂಡೆಗಳು (ಲೇಡಿಬರ್ಡ್ಸ್) ಇದ್ದಿದ್ದರೆ... ಗಿಡಗಳನ್ನು ಕೊಲ್ಲುವ ಕೀಟಗಳನ್ನು ತಿನ್ನುತ್ತಿದ್ದವು!","ಅವಿಲ್ಲದೇ ತೋಟ ಉಳಿಯುವುದಿಲ್ಲ,” ಎಂದು ಪೇಚಾಡಿದರು ಅಜ್ಜ."]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/580312-phaarookajjana-tota/p10.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["“ಜೀರುಂಡೆಗಳು ತಾನೇ ಅಜ್ಜ...","ನಾ ತರ್ತೀನಿ. ಎಷ್ಟ್ ಬೇಕು ಹೇಳಿ. ಒಂದು..? ಎರಡು..?” ಕೇಳಿದ ಅಮೀರ್."]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/580312-phaarookajjana-tota/p11.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಒಂದು ವಾರ ಪೂರ್ತಿ ಎಲ್ಲ ಕಡೆ ಹುಡುಕಿ, ಅಮೀರ್ ಜೀರುಂಡೆಗಳನ್ನು ಸಂಗ್ರಹಿಸಿದ."]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/580312-phaarookajjana-tota/p12.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಅವನಿಗೆ ಆಟದ ಮೈದಾನದಲ್ಲಿ ಸಿಕ್ಕಿತು ಒಂದು ಜೀರುಂಡೆ."]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/580312-phaarookajjana-tota/p13.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಅಂಗಡಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಸಿಕ್ಕವು ಎರಡು."]},{"n":14,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/580312-phaarookajjana-tota/p14.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಪಾರ್ಕಿನಲ್ಲಿ ಸಿಕ್ಕವು ಮೂರು."]},{"n":15,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/580312-phaarookajjana-tota/p15.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಟಿವಿ ಹಿಂದೆ ಸಿಕ್ಕವು ನಾಲ್ಕು."]},{"n":16,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/580312-phaarookajjana-tota/p16.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಮುಂದಿನವಾರ ಅಮೀರ್ ಹತ್ತು ಜೀರುಂಡೆಗಳ ಜೊತೆ ಫಾರೂಕಜ್ಜನ ಮನೆ ಹೋದ.","“ಓಹ್... ಶಬ್ಬಾಹಸ್ ಪುಟ್ಟ. ಹತ್ತು ಜೀರುಂಡೆಗಳನ್ನ ಸಂಗ್ರಹಿಸಿದ್ದಿ...” ಎಂದರು ಅಜ್ಜ."]},{"n":17,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/580312-phaarookajjana-tota/p17.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಅಜ್ಜ ತುಂಬಾ ಖುಷಿಯಾಗಿದ್ದರು.","ಜೀರುಂಡೆಗಳಿಗೆ ತುಂಬಾ ಹಸಿವಾಗಿತ್ತು!"]},{"n":18,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/580312-phaarookajjana-tota/p18.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಜೀರುಂಡೆಗಳು ಕೀಟಗಳನ್ನೆಲ್ಲ ತಿಂದವು.","ತೋಟ ಮೊದಲಿಂತೆ ಆಯಿತು."]},{"n":19,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/580312-phaarookajjana-tota/p19.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಆವತ್ತಿಂದ ಅಜ್ಜನ ತೋಟ, ಹೆಚ್ಚೆಚ್ಚು ಹಣ್ಣು-ಹಂಪಲು ಬಿಡಲು ಪ್ರಾರಂಭಿಸಿತು."]},{"n":20,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/580312-phaarookajjana-tota/p20.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]}],"wordCount":165}